{"$defs":{"BranchLegV1":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"One Branch leg (#141: rich bodies).\n\nSteps are the linear vocabulary plus ``connector_call`` and ``process_call``;\nthe terminal is a routed target endpoint, a target-less staging ``cache_put``\n(the live staging pattern), a plain ``stop``, or a nested ``decision``.\n\nA nested ``branch`` is deliberately ABSENT: the live capture proves Branch-leg\n-> Decision (`.codex/plans/issue-141-live-captures.md` \u00a72.1) but records no\nBranch-leg -> Branch anywhere, and fail-closed is the rule for an unproven\nplacement.","properties":{"steps":{"items":{"discriminator":{"mapping":{"cache_get":"#/$defs/CacheGetNodeV1","cache_put":"#/$defs/CachePutNodeV1","cache_remove":"#/$defs/CacheRemoveNodeV1","connector_call":"#/$defs/ConnectorCallNodeV1","data_process":"#/$defs/DataProcessNodeV1","document_cache_retrieve":"#/$defs/DocumentCacheRetrieveNodeV1","flow_control":"#/$defs/FlowControlNodeV1","map_ref":"#/$defs/MapRefNodeV1","message":"#/$defs/MessageNodeV1","process_call":"#/$defs/ProcessCallNodeV1","set_ddp":"#/$defs/SetDdpNodeV1","set_dpp":"#/$defs/SetDppNodeV1"},"propertyName":"kind"},"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/FlowControlNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/MessageNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/MapRefNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/DataProcessNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/CachePutNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/DocumentCacheRetrieveNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/CacheGetNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/CacheRemoveNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/SetDdpNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/SetDppNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/ConnectorCallNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/ProcessCallNodeV1"}]},"title":"Steps","type":"array"},"terminal":{"discriminator":{"mapping":{"cache_put":"#/$defs/CachePutNodeV1","decision":"#/$defs/DecisionNodeV1","stop":"#/$defs/StopNodeV1","target":"#/$defs/TargetEndpointV1"},"propertyName":"kind"},"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/TargetEndpointV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/CachePutNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/StopNodeV1"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/DecisionNodeV1"}],"title":"Termina